        "@value": "3-hydroxypristanoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix] + NAD+ [peroxisomal matrix] => 3-ketopristanoyl-CoA [peroxisomal matrix] + H+ [peroxisomal matrix] + NADH [peroxisomal matrix]"
