eotide phosphate\", \"beta-Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"TPN\", \"Triphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29366\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29366.5\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 dehydrogenates 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3 to 7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 9026050, \"displayName\": \"7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3 [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"7,8-epoxy,17-HDPAn-3\", \"7,8-epoxy,17-hydroxy-(9E,11E,13Z,15E,19Z)-docosapentaenoate\", \"7,8-epoxy,17-HDPA(n-3)(1-)\", \"7,8-epoxy,17-hydroxy-(9E,11E,13Z,15E,19Z)-docosapentaenoic acid\", \"7,8-epoxy, 17-hydroxy-omega3-docosapentaenoic acid\", \"7,8-epoxy, 17-hydroxydocosapentaenoic acid\"], \"producedByEvent\": [11051150], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-9026050\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-9026050.5\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29364, \"displayName\": \"NADPH [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADPH\", \"NADPH(4-)\", \"TPNH\"], \"producedByEvent\": [11051150], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29364\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29364.4\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 11051152, \"displayName\": \"ALOX5 oxidises 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3 to 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3\", \"followingEvent\": [11051150], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"ALOX5 oxidises 17(S)-Hp-DPAn-3 to 7,17-diHp-DPAn-3\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"stId\": \"R-DDI-9025996\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DDI-9025996.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"DDI\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 170941, \"displayName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"name\": [\"Dictyostelium discoideum\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"44689\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"stId\": \"R-DDI-9025995\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DDI-9025995.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\"}]}"
