y CEPT1 at the ER membrane\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"stId\": \"R-DDI-1482961\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DDI-1482961.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 11024314, \"displayName\": \"1-acyl LPC is acylated to PC by LPCAT\", \"followingEvent\": [11024471], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"1-acyl LPC is acylated to PC by LPCAT\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"stId\": \"R-DDI-1482547\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DDI-1482547.1\"}, {\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 11024290, \"displayName\": \"2-acyl LPC is acylated to PC by LPCAT\", \"followingEvent\": [11024471], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"2-acyl LPC is acylated to PC by LPCAT\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"stId\": \"R-DDI-1482533\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DDI-1482533.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"DDI\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 170941, \"displayName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"name\": [\"Dictyostelium discoideum\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"44689\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"stId\": \"R-DDI-1482827\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DDI-1482827.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping)