      {
        "@value": "4a-carboxy-4b-me-5a-cholest-8-en-3b-ol [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + NADP+ [cytosol] => NADPH [cytosol] + 4a-me-5a-cholest-8-en-3-one [endoplasmic reticulum membrane] + CO2 [cytosol]"
