"NADPH(4-)\", \"TPNH\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29364\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29364.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"consumedByEvent\": [11053695], \"dbId\": 70106, \"displayName\": \"H+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"H+\", \"hydron\", \"proton\"], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-70106\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-70106.5\"}], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"SRD5A3 dehydrogenates TEST to DHTEST\", \"Testosterone is converted to 5-alpha-dihydroxytestosterone\"], \"output\": [{\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 469662, \"displayName\": \"DHTEST [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"DHTEST\", \"17beta-hydroxy-5alpha-androstan-3-one\", \"5-alpha-dihydrotestosterone\"], \"producedByEvent\": [11053695], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-469662\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-469662.4\"}, {\"className\": \"Chemical Compound\", \"dbId\": 29366, \"displayName\": \"NADP+ [cytosol]\", \"inDisease\": false, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"NADP+\", \"NADP(3-)\", \"NADP\", \"NADP(+)\", \"Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"beta-Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate\", \"TPN\", \"Triphosphopyridine nucleotide\"], \"producedByEvent\": [11053695], \"referenceType\": \"ReferenceMolecule\", \"schemaClass\": \"SimpleEntity\", \"stId\": \"R-ALL-29366\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-ALL-29366.5\"}], \"precedingEvent\": [{\"category\": \"transition\", \"className\": \"Reaction\", \"dbId\": 11013472, \"displayName\": \"HSD17B3-like proteins reducde ANDST to TEST\", \"followingEvent\": [11053695], \"isInDisease\": false, \"isInferred\": true, \"maxDepth\": 1, \"name\": [\"HSD17B3-like proteins reducde ANDST to TEST\", \"Reduction of androstenedione to testosterone\"], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"speciesName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"stId\": \"R-DDI-193064\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DDI-193064.1\"}], \"releaseDate\": \"2026-06-17\", \"schemaClass\": \"Reaction\", \"species\": [{\"abbreviation\": \"DDI\", \"className\": \"Species\", \"dbId\": 170941, \"displayName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"name\": [\"Dictyostelium discoideum\"], \"schemaClass\": \"Species\", \"taxId\": \"44689\"}], \"speciesName\": \"Dictyostelium discoideum\", \"stId\": \"R-DDI-9705714\", \"stIdVersion\": \"R-DDI-9705714.1\", \"summation\": [{\"className\": \"Summation\", \"dbId\": 9990864, \"displayName\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW'>More details and caveats of the event inference in Reactome.</a> For details on PANTHER see also: <a href='http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp' target='NEW'>http://www.pantherdb.org/about.jsp</a>\", \"schemaClass\": \"Summation\", \"text\": \"This event has been computationally inferred from an event that has been demonstrated in another species.<p>The inference is based on the homology mapping from PANTHER. Briefly, reactions for which all involved PhysicalEntities (in input, output and catalyst) have a mapped orthologue/paralogue (for complexes at least 75% of components must have a mapping) are inferred to the other species. High level events are also inferred for these events to allow for easier navigation.<p><a href='/electronic_inference_compara.html' target = 'NEW